  <item>
    <title>【探案笔记】日本“怪人21面相”事件 Vol.197</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aeb07c7c96c8942ec17489a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aeb07c7c96c8942ec17489a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><p><span>它被称作日本剧场型犯罪的鼻祖，犯人主动写信、主动和媒体对话、公开嘲弄警方，像导演一样，把整个日本变成了他的舞台。署名 “怪人二十一面相”，凭空出现，又悄无声息退场，留给后世无尽的猜想。</span></p><p></p><p><span>主播：白夜、马老司</span></p><p><span>后期：马老司</span></p><p><span>投稿邮箱：ditanradio@qq.com</span></p><p><span>V：m945930451</span><br></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 日本经济巅峰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a> 格力高</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 绑匪的要求</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1241">20:41</a> 自导自演？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1551">25:51</a> 怪人二十一面相</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1858">30:58</a> 神秘勒索</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">36:11</a> 糖果投毒事件</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2482">41:22</a> 自焚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 嫌疑人</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpasD6xxsvh4OoP_7b8DakdLSN2S.jpg"><p><span>格力高广告</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSO8LXbS2fmvL-YmTBcE_vLyJtj.jpg"><p><span>江崎社长绑架案的新闻</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgwp7Ac59atrNZqICxFUen52SwZ2.jpg"><p><span>10亿日元与100公斤金条</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoVqXtifss0UkPOX-ZYaOfq7f2VN.jpg"><p><span>警方检查糖果</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjeCS8JJYWk78Mg2TbYmLzeD20Da.jpg"><p><span>怪人二十面相</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkS3GFvQqu2qHp-Jvn98P9de6yBM.jpg"><p><span>疑似投毒男子</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgXLK1B65Mmqj92Gk5_hD25oJlLD.jpg"><p><span>自杀的山本部长</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqyIhS0d5c04cWN7GknR00_AVtl_.jpg"><p><span>作家宫崎与嫌疑人画像</span><br></p><p><span>资料来源：</span></p><p><span>1、グリコ・森永事件 ― 胁迫状・挑戦状 全文(原文ママ)</span></p><p><span>2、无差别投毒悬案:怪人二十一面相事件始末——澎湃新闻</span></p><p><span>3、日本最大悬案!怪盗绑架下毒全国恐慌，130万警察抓不到他——凤凰网</span></p><p><span></span></p>]]></description>
