  <item>
    <title>【探案笔记】现实版《消失的爱人》 Vol.193</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aaf9cfeac389df82734b264</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aaf9cfeac389df82734b264</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><p><span>一对情侣深夜在家遇袭，劫匪直呼其名，还声称绑错人；女生被掳走 400 公里，两天之后孤身出现在老家街头；报警求助之后，受害者没有迎来保护，反而被警方、被全社会认定，这是一场模仿小说的自导自演的闹剧……更荒诞的是，最后站出来替受害者作证清白的，竟然是那个绑架施暴的凶手本人。这是一场意外，还是精心设局？</span></p><p><span>主播：白夜、马老司</span></p><p><span>投稿邮箱：ditanradio@qq.com</span></p><p><span>V：m945930451</span></p><p><br></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 入室绑架案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a> 混乱三角关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> 劫匪的失误</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> 疑点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 伴侣作案？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1557">25:57</a> 肉票自己回来了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a> 自导自演</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> 网暴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 真凶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2802">46:42</a> 高智商or精神病？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3113">51:53</a> 欠一个道歉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3423">57:03</a> 疑点重重</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgxmo_XorSGguhyVJHRUkIWWAolU.png"><p><span>亚伦与丹尼斯</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpMD2lrdqQaWCkK0-syPfvc94F07.jpg"><p><span>真凶马修</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuz6wiJQ4VQ-Bzy-qEKKqsmahBst.jpg"><p><span>沾满胶带的泳镜</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo3duQmXG7xl1qqDtb3bvjtkM4La.jpg"><p><span>绑着激光笔的假枪</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsQ7nxqqRc3MXO8avWUnIP4qELrr.jpg"><p><span>亚伦一家三口</span><br></p><p><span>资料来源：</span></p><p><span>1.Netflix 纪录片《American Nightmare》2024</span></p><p><span>2.美国联邦法院马修・穆勒绑架案庭审公开卷宗</span></p><p><span>3.Atavist Magazine深度报道《A Crime Beyond Belief》</span></p><p><span></span></p>]]></description>
