    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>长岛海滩惊现连环抛尸，十多名女性惨遭毒手，凶手潜伏三十年后突然认罪！他是谁？为何专挑性工作者下手？警方当年为何对求救电话置之不理？真相令人愤怒又心寒。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：沫沫、王不掉、马老司</span></p><span></span><p><span>投稿邮箱：ditanradio@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>V：m945930451</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 长岛吉尔戈海滩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="339">05:39</a> 惊魂911</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> 一个母亲的坚强求索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">16:58</a> 专用抛尸地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a> 腐败与无能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1697">28:17</a> 重启调查</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> 新线索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2376">39:36</a> 嫌疑人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3056">50:56</a> 黑暗中的恶魔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3393">56:33</a> 长岛连环杀手之谜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3735">62:15</a> 社会边缘性群体的悲剧</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9jZG4ubGl6aGkuZm0vYXVkaW9fY292ZXIvMjAyNi8wNC8yMS8zMjA3Mzg0OTIxMTkzNjQ0NTUxLmpwZw=="></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9jZG4ubGl6aGkuZm0vYXVkaW9fY292ZXIvMjAyNi8wNC8yMS8zMjA3Mzg0OTcyNzMzNTI0NDg3LmpwZw=="></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9jZG4ubGl6aGkuZm0vYXVkaW9fY292ZXIvMjAyNi8wNC8yMS8zMjA3Mzg1MDExMDgyNTM2OTY3LmpwZw=="></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9jZG4ubGl6aGkuZm0vYXVkaW9fY292ZXIvMjAyNi8wNC8yMS8zMjA3Mzg1MDQzNjAxMDA3MTExLmpwZw=="></p>]]></description>
